      "cite": "Roads not maintained by NCDOT \"shall be dedicated to a property owners association\"; \"The property owners association shall be established before the lots are sold\"; \"Membership in the association shall be mandatory for each lot buyer and all successive buyers.\"",
      "url": "https://www.brunswickcountync.gov/DocumentCenter/View/5460",
