 "northeast-florida": {
  "sections": [
   {
    "h2": "Check current irrigation rules for your address",
    "body": [
     "The St. Johns River Water Management District put a Phase III Extreme Water Shortage over portions of nine counties on 11 May 2026 under Order 2026-017, Nassau, Duval, Clay and St. Johns among them. It was still in force on 3 September 2026. Landscape irrigation is cut to one day a week and banned between 8 a.m. and 6 p.m.",
